AD  - Institute of Structural Concrete, RWTH Aachen University, Aachen; 52074, GermanyNesseler Bau GmbH, Aachen; 52076, GermanyInstitute of Building Materials Research, RWTH Aachen University, Aachen; 52062, Germany
